    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "all those programs... they dont work for someone like me. its not just about bills, its the shame of it all. i've failed everyone. my family, my job, everything. it feels like the debt is just a physical weight on my chest and the only way to actually stop breathing it in is to just... stop. it's like there's no version of the future where i'm not a walking disaster.",
