      "content": "helplines dont fix the math. the math is what's broken. i look at the numbers and i see a hole that just keeps getting bigger. its not just \"darkness\", its a fact. it's a logical conclusion. i'm just tired of the constant panic, of waking up and realizing it's still there. why do people act like there's always a way out when for some people, the struggle itself is the problem?",
